cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "packagesearch: Module to scan Stata .do files and identify SSC packages used by the code"
abstract: >-
  packagesearch scans, parses, and matches all Stata .do files in a directory
  (and its subdirectories) against a list of all packages currently hosted at
  SSC, and outputs a list of candidate SSC packages that were (likely) used
  when the code was run.
authors:
